From: =?UTF-8?q?Micha=C5=82=20=C5=BBygowski?= <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] configs/pcengines_seabios_apu*: log SeaBIOS debug to CBMEM
 only
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Set the SeaBIOS debug level to 7 and disable SeaBIOS serial debug in
all PC Engines apu SeaBIOS configs. SeaBIOS logs go to the CBMEM
console only, so the serial output stays unchanged. Increase the CBMEM
console size to 1M, so that the SeaBIOS logs do not fill it up.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Platform specific configuration]
Signed-off-by: Michał Żygowski <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
diff --git a/configs/config.pcengines_seabios_apu2 b/configs/config.pcengines_seabios_apu2
index 0a664222cc35..9fb5ffc5206b 100644
--- a/configs/config.pcengines_seabios_apu2
+++ b/configs/config.pcengines_seabios_apu2
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ CONFIG_TPM_MEASURED_BOOT=y
 CONFIG_NO_GFX_INIT=y
 CONFIG_TPM1=y
 CONFIG_TPM2=y
+CONFIG_CONSOLE_CBMEM_BUFFER_SIZE=0x100000
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_CONSOLE_LOGLEVEL_1=y
 # CONFIG_CONSOLE_USE_LOGLEVEL_PREFIX is not set
 # CONFIG_CONSOLE_USE_ANSI_ESCAPES is not set
@@ -27,7 +28,8 @@ CONFIG_SEABIOS_BOOTORDER_FILE="$(top)/src/mainboard/$(MAINBOARDDIR)/variants/$(C
 CONFIG_SEABIOS_REVISION=y
 CONFIG_SEABIOS_REVISION_ID="rel-1.16.3.2"
 CONFIG_SEABIOS_BOOTORDER_IN_FMAP=y
-CONFIG_SEABIOS_DEBUG_LEVEL=0
+CONFIG_SEABIOS_DEBUG_LEVEL=7
+# CONFIG_SEABIOS_DEBUG_SERIAL is not set
 CONFIG_PXE=y
 CONFIG_BUILD_IPXE=y
 # CONFIG_IPXE_SERIAL_CONSOLE is not set
